      "text": "STAMP R5 (docs/pending/STAMP.md, BUGLIST 55b): with a dater held over the passport (the left button down), press Esc, right-click, Q, A or TAB, then let the button go, in the reading view and (all but TAB) in the office view. Pass (hold.*): the key ends the hold, the dater goes back unpressed and nothing is stamped. Alt+Tab (focus loss) waits for DOC-HANDLE's HoldRegistry.Desk.OnFocusLost (#8) and is not driven here. Needs StampRig's ops."
